course: dictionary
lesson: 12428
title: Short words and their full forms
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Writers often shorten long words to save space. An abbreviation is a short form of a word, and it usually ends with a full stop or has capital letters. «We fly home on 14 Dec.» Here Dec is short for December, the twelfth month of the year.
explain: The same short form can mean different things in different places. «Round the answer to 2 dec. places.» In maths, dec. means decimal, the dot and numbers after it. Always check the subject you are reading about.
explain: Dec is not a word people say on its own. You will find it on calendars, forms and in lists. «Dec» also appears at the start of longer words like decide and decorate, but those are whole words, not short forms.
fact: An abbreviation is a shortened form of a word.
fact: «Dec» is short for December, the twelfth and last month of the year.
fact: In maths, «dec.» means decimal, as in «2 dec. places».
fact: In a list, «dec.» can mean decreased or went down, so read the sentence around it.
fact: Dec is also the start of longer words such as decide and decorate, but on their own those words are not abbreviations.
exercise: «We fly home on 14 Dec.» What does Dec mean here? | *December, the twelfth month of the year | Decide, to choose one thing | Decrease, to get smaller | Decimal point
exercise: «Round the answer to 2 dec. places.» In maths, what does dec. mean? | Deceased | *Decimal | Decorate | December
exercise: «Mum wrote the date as 5 Dec. on the form.» What does Dec. stand for? | Decorate | Decide | *December | Decay
test: «Sales dec. by 10% this year.» What does dec. mean in this sentence? | *Decreased, went down | Decimal | Decide | Dec. as in December
test: Which of these is a whole word that starts with dec- but is not a short form? | Dec | Dec | *Decorate | Dec.
exam: Which is the short form of December that you would write on a calendar? | *Dec | Decay | Decide | Decade
